# PXQ universal-quant tier-SELECTION recipe (private; the engine/codec/quantizer stay open).
# pxa-bench/pxqu_ref.cpp (decode reference) is intentionally NOT ignored — it is needed to USE the quants.
# pxa-bench/pxq-universal ships its documented text: the .tiers reference budgets and
# tier-maps.json (PXQU-CONVERT.md: \"Three reference budgets ship\") and the Q-G1/Q-G2
# determinism-gate scripts (bench/determinism-gates.md). Only bulk generated artifacts
# (GGUFs, fixtures) stay out of the repo.
pxa-bench/pxq-universal/**/*.gguf
pxa-bench/pxq-universal/*.gguf
